# Second-harness mirrors (Codex/AGENTS.md ports of .claude/*) — DELIBERATELY not in
# this repo (2026-08-06). A hand-copied mirror is a second source of truth with no
# generator: it drifted twice within an hour of a .claude/* edit, and the AGENTS.md
# port carried a fabricated `Co-Authored-By` that would have entered git history.
# If a Codex lane is ever wanted: generate it from .claude/* in a build step, never copy.
AGENTS.md
.codex/
.agents/
